sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Staff as Service team
    participant SPA as React SPA
    participant API as Flask API
    participant MY as MySQL 8.4
    participant OB as analytics_outbox
    participant PJ as Projector
    participant TS as TimescaleDB
    participant CA as Continuous aggregates

    Staff->>SPA: Pick table, dishes, chef assignments
    SPA->>API: POST /api/orders
    API->>MY: BEGIN · insert order + order_item rows
    MY->>OB: INSERT 1 + N domain events (same transaction)
    API->>MY: Mark order PLACED · COMMIT
    API->>PJ: sync after commit
    PJ->>OB: SELECT … FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
    PJ->>TS: Batch INSERT order_event · ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
    TS->>CA: Real-time tail + 30-minute refresh policies
    PJ->>OB: SET processed_at = NOW(6)
    API-->>SPA: 201 · order detail + sync summary

    Staff->>SPA: Start prep → mark prepared → bill → pay
    SPA->>API: POST status / bill / payments
    API->>MY: Transactional state changes
    MY->>OB: ORDER_PREPARING, ORDER_PREPARED,<br/>BILL_GENERATED, PAYMENT_RECEIVED, ORDER_CLOSED
    API->>PJ: sync after each commit
    PJ->>TS: Append the new events
    SPA->>API: GET /api/analytics/revenue-series
    API->>CA: SELECT time_bucket(…) FROM sales_hourly
    CA-->>SPA: Chart-ready rows

    Note over MY,TS: Historical backfill bypasses the outbox:<br/>the deterministic seed COPY-loads 283,632 events directly.
